{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに書いてなかったですが\n乃木坂46 2ndアルバムの発売が\n決定してましたね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに伴い個別握手会も決まりましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の関東5部制\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもより会場数が少ないとはいえ\n中田、終わってなかったんですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前までは\n下降線の一途かと思ってたけど\nそうではなかったみたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"V字"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、全盛期越えちゃうような\nルート√的な人生になれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の個別は\nアルバム１枚につき２枚セットの握手券です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場は\n京都、幕張、横浜です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3会場しかないから\n名古屋無かったりとか\n予定あわせるの大変だったりとか\n当たりにくくなったりとか\nあるかもしれませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれるの待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から\nアンダーライブ全国ツアー 東北シリーズです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、福島"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日から\nいいライブにしましょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パティスリーSAKURA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンSAKURA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンブランは\nスポンジよりもメレンゲかタルトとかの\n食感のある土台が好みの中田に\nぴったりなモンブラン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中の生クリームには\n砕いた栗がごろごろ入ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/18/9003777/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}